  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting sustainable livelihoods in Peru - Joint project component</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CAFOD is looking to develop the livelihoods programme in Lima, Peru, with three partners &#x2013; EDUCA, IES and Solidaridad para el Desarrollo. The programme aims to improve the standard of living, self esteem and leadership skills of vulnerable young people, young people living with HIV and AIDS and women living in poor urban communities by the three partners sharing training methodology, participating in joint marketing activities and developing joint advocacy plans in order to have greater impact.</narrative>
  </description>
